 1. Define exact scope.
 - Confirm target university IDs.
 - Confirm only faculty general selection (`一般選抜/学部入試`).
 - Confirm year range and subjects to include.
+
+1.1 Execution gate: one university at a time.
+- Pick exactly 1 university.
+- Complete end-to-end for that university:
+  - official link discovery (current page contents only)
+  - PDF content inspection (manual verification)
+  - fixes creation
+  - deletion (DB + R2)
