 2. Rebuild from zero when requested.
- Delete target university rows from `kakomon_documents`.
- Delete target R2 prefix (`<university_id>/`).
+- Prefer *scoped deletion* when the agreed scope is "currently linked years only":
+  - Delete DB rows by `(university_id, year)` pairs.
+  - Delete R2 objects by `(<university_id>/<year>/)` prefixes.
+- Only use full-university deletion (`<university_id>/`) when the scope is "all historical years" or explicitly requested.
 - Do this only when user explicitly asks to ignore existing data.
